       "  'iv Community Engagement and Accountability CEA Component This section ensures that individuals have access to timely and accurate information about the nature and extent of assistance and services provided by LRC.',\n",
       "  'It also emphasizes making people aware of the expected behaviors of both staff and volunteers.',\n",
       "  'Throughout the operational cycle, LRCs local volunteers and community members will be mobilized to support these assessments and remain involved.',\n",
